From 89ba8527d6662adebf5dbfb08ed13c47a3d57740 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lance Albertson <lance@osuosl.org>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 10:45:20 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/31] a210: dts: build only a210-dev.dtb unconditionally

Group 40 imported the vendor zhihe DTS Makefile verbatim, which lists seven
boards (a210-evb*, a210-som-v1, a210-usb-aistick) gated on CONFIG_ARCH_ZHIHE.
Only a210-dev.dts is part of this subset, so the other six break the DTB build,
and the group-35 driver-wiring fixup (which could not apply because the zhihe/
directory did not exist yet at group-35 apply time) intended dtb-y here so the
DTB always builds without depending on group-00's CONFIG_ARCH_ZHIHE gate.

Trim the Makefile to 'dtb-y += a210-dev.dtb'.

Signed-off-by: Lance Albertson <lance@osuosl.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 arch/riscv/boot/dts/zhihe/Makefile | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/zhihe/Makefile b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/zhihe/Makefile
index b445dfeb19e4a..13fc7a4c6d91e 100644
--- a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/zhihe/Makefile
+++ b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/zhihe/Makefile
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
-
-dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ZHIHE) += a210-evb.dtb a210-dev.dtb a210-evb-d2d.dtb 
-dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ZHIHE) += a210-evb-sec.dtb a210-dev-sec.dtb
-dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ZHIHE) += a210-som-v1.dtb a210-usb-aistick.dtb
+# A210 is the only board in our import; build its DTB unconditionally.
+# The vendor's a210-evb*/som/usb-aistick sources are not part of this subset,
+# and gating on CONFIG_ARCH_ZHIHE is unnecessary (the OSL group-35 wiring fixup
+# deliberately uses dtb-y). See kernel/patches/README.md (group-40 fixup).
+dtb-y += a210-dev.dtb
-- 
